Package: dock-receiver-dockremote
Name: Dock Receiver: dock remote (iPhone OS 3)
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Maintainer: dock-receiver project
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: dock-receiver (= @VERSION@), firmware (>= 3.0), firmware (<< 4.0)
Section: Tweaks
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/azarzycki/fidelio
Description: the speaker dock's IR remote drives dock-receiver (iPhone OS 3.x)
 DockRemote, a MobileSubstrate tweak in iapd: the dock remote's play/pause,
 next and previous go to dock-audiod. Needs MobileSubstrate (checked by its
 files, not by a dependency). It takes effect after an undocked
 `killall iapd` or a reboot; the package never restarts iapd itself.
